<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφίᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			= foreg., freq. of Ithaca in <i><span class="en">
			Od.
		</span></i>, as <i><span class="en">
			1.386
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			395
		</span></i>; of Lemnos, <i><span class="en">
			S.
			<u>Ph.</u>
			146
		</span></i>; with ref. to Corinth, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of two seas,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. Ποτειδᾶνος τεθμοί,</span> of
			Isthmian games, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>living amid seas,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.667e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδός</span>) dub. l. in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.2.13
			</span></i>.</div>
